;
; May this guest join the gathering (bonfire_rules.h BR1), in MYRA: the
; guest's line of the invite list filed as ^ZXBONFIREJOIN, the guest's
; place on the list the key and the seats left once the guest's party is
; seated its piece, each a $H day, so a margin below 0 does not fit
; (MYRA's date is 0 to 2980013): a listpos of -1 is a guest not on the
; list, a seatroom below 0 a party with no room. join.eve holds each to
; its meaning (0..99, 0..9999); a larger margin fits a day and not the
; meaning: held.
^ZXBONFIREJOIN(listpos:d) = seatroom:d!
